    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      292.25,
      401.85,
      316.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Pradeshiya Sabhas(Amendment) Act, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      330.41,
      401.9,
      379.79
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 19 of the Pradeshiya Sabhas Act, No. 15 of1987 (hereinafter in this Act referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (1) of thatsection as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      393.89,
      401.89,
      443.27
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the substitution, in paragraph (xiv) for the words\u201cimprovement or maintenance of village works,\u201dof the words \u201cimprovement or maintenance ofvillage works or estate settlements,\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      457.37,
      401.89,
      506.87
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the substitution, in paragraph (xxii) for the words\u201cintegrated development of selected villages,\u201d ofthe words \u201cintegrated development of selectedvillages, estate settlements,\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      520.85,
      401.88,
      544.91
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 33 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      559.01,
      401.86,
      583.07
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the renumbering of that section as subsection(1) thereof;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      597.05,
      401.91,
      621.11
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the insertion, immediately after the renumberedsubsection (1), of the following subsection:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
