      370.91
    ],
    "text": "For the purpose of this section, \u201cplantationregions\u201d means the areas coming under theDivisional Secretary\u2019s Divisions in the Districts inthe Central, Uva, Sabaragamuwa, Southern, Westernand North Central Provinces, where the residentlabourers live in the estates in which tea, rubber,coconut and oil palm are cultivated.\u201d.",
